{"schema_version": 1, "recipe": "宫保鸡丁", "local_recipe_id": "local:75ae25bd086fc79c2890", "source": "meat_dish/宫保鸡丁/宫保鸡丁.md", "content_sha256": "880f60f3e24e1c841a823f6edf1ff42912f9de2943e5666ebc9a373a57f52182", "production": {"status": "local_fallback", "reason": "step_source_not_verified", "graph_recipe_id": null, "vector_status": "not_attempted", "accepted_chunks": 0, "rejected_chunks": 0}, "candidate_graph_recipe_id": "201002454", "identity": {"unique_exact_name": true, "matches": [{"recipe_id": "201002454", "recipe_name": "宫保鸡丁"}]}, "note": "诊断不改变v5准入判定；最近原文行和格式线索需要人工复核", "steps": {"count": 9, "over_limit": false, "order_unique_sorted": true, "source_sequence_ok": false, "items": [{"step_id": "201002477", "name": "步骤1", "step_order": 1.0, "owner_ids": ["201002454"], "normalized_characters": 35, "reasons": ["description_not_in_target_source"], "description": {"text": "手枪腿去骨，用刀背拍松后切成1.5cm见方肉丁，清水浸泡10分钟，捞出控干备用", "characters": 39, "truncated": false}, "closest_source_line": {"line": 80, "lexical_ratio": 0.6078, "text": "- 手枪腿用剪刀去骨，鸡肉面用刀背拍打一遍，切条后切至 1.5cm 见方肉丁；泡于清水 10 分钟，捞出控干备用（若是鸡胸脯肉，则可以直接进行切丁以及之后的动作）；", "characters": 82, "truncated": false}, "format_hint": {"long_payload_lines": 1, "supported_lines": 0, "unsupported_lines": 1, "all_long_payload_lines_supported": false, "note": "仅作格式差异排查线索，不代表语义正确，不自动放行"}}, {"step_id": "201002478", "name": "步骤2", "step_order": 2.0, "owner_ids": ["201002454"], "normalized_characters": 39, "reasons": ["description_not_in_target_source"], "description": {"text": "大葱绿与5g姜片加50g开水泡成葱姜水；葱白切1.5cm圆粒；花生微波高火5分钟焙干", "characters": 42, "truncated": false}, "closest_source_line": {"line": 65, "lexical_ratio": 0.6966, "text": "- 取大葱葱绿与姜片 5g 于碗中，倒入 50g 开水备用；葱白切 1.5cm 圆粒备用；取花生放入微波炉高火 5 分钟焙干备用", "characters": 64, "truncated": false}, "format_hint": {"long_payload_lines": 1, "supported_lines": 0, "unsupported_lines": 1, "all_long_payload_lines_supported": false, "note": "仅作格式差异排查线索，不代表语义正确，不自动放行"}}, {"step_id": "201002479", "name": "步骤3", "step_order": 3.0, "owner_ids": ["201002454"], "normalized_characters": 45, "reasons": ["description_not_in_target_source"], "description": {"text": "鸡丁加盐2g、老抽5g、料酒15g、淀粉15g拌匀至发干，再分次加入葱姜水搅至粘手，盖膜冷藏腌1小时", "characters": 50, "truncated": false}, "closest_source_line": {"line": 82, "lexical_ratio": 0.7222, "text": "- 鸡丁中加入盐 2g，老抽酱油 5g，料酒 15g，淀粉 15g 搅拌均匀，至微微发干；缓慢加入部分葱姜水，搅拌鸡丁至粘手；保鲜膜密封，放入冰箱腌制 1 小时", "characters": 80, "truncated": false}, "format_hint": {"long_payload_lines": 1, "supported_lines": 0, "unsupported_lines": 1, "all_long_payload_lines_supported": false, "note": "仅作格式差异排查线索，不代表语义正确，不自动放行"}}, {"step_id": "201002480", "name": "步骤4", "step_order": 4.0, "owner_ids": ["201002454"], "normalized_characters": 25, "reasons": ["description_not_in_target_source"], "description": {"text": "干辣椒切段；小火焙干辣椒至微糊，再焙香花椒，分别捞出备用", "characters": 28, "truncated": false}, "closest_source_line": {"line": 67, "lexical_ratio": 0.5373, "text": "- 干辣椒切段；起锅，大火烧热转小火；放入干辣椒焙干至微微发糊，捞起备用；花椒焙干至有香味，捞起备用", "characters": 50, "truncated": false}, "format_hint": {"long_payload_lines": 1, "supported_lines": 0, "unsupported_lines": 1, "all_long_payload_lines_supported": false, "note": "仅作格式差异排查线索，不代表语义正确，不自动放行"}}, {"step_id": "201002481", "name": "步骤5", "step_order": 5.0, "owner_ids": ["201002454"], "normalized_characters": 33, "reasons": ["description_not_in_target_source"], "description": {"text": "大火热锅倒20g油，7成热下鸡丁煎至表面发白，翻面再煎30秒后翻炒均匀", "characters": 35, "truncated": false}, "closest_source_line": {"line": 68, "lexical_ratio": 0.7179, "text": "- 转大火，倒入 20g 植物油，7 成热（竹筷子起泡）下入鸡丁，煎至上面开始发白，用锅铲翻面，煎 30s 后翻炒均匀", "characters": 59, "truncated": false}, "format_hint": {"long_payload_lines": 1, "supported_lines": 0, "unsupported_lines": 1, "all_long_payload_lines_supported": false, "note": "仅作格式差异排查线索，不代表语义正确，不自动放行"}}, {"step_id": "201002482", "name": "步骤6", "step_order": 6.0, "owner_ids": ["201002454"], "normalized_characters": 31, "reasons": ["description_not_in_target_source"], "description": {"text": "加入葱粒翻炒，倒入剩余葱姜水（不足100g补热水），盖盖中小火焖2分钟", "characters": 35, "truncated": false}, "closest_source_line": {"line": 69, "lexical_ratio": 0.7123, "text": "- 下入葱粒翻炒，加入余下葱姜水不够 100g 再加一点清水（务必是热水）；盖上锅盖，转中小火焖 2 分钟；", "characters": 54, "truncated": false}, "format_hint": {"long_payload_lines": 1, "supported_lines": 0, "unsupported_lines": 1, "all_long_payload_lines_supported": false, "note": "仅作格式差异排查线索，不代表语义正确，不自动放行"}}, {"step_id": "201002483", "name": "步骤7", "step_order": 7.0, "owner_ids": ["201002454"], "normalized_characters": 33, "reasons": ["description_not_in_target_source"], "description": {"text": "开盖转大火，加入熟花生、干辣椒、花椒，调入鸡精2g、香醋5g、白糖2g翻炒均匀", "characters": 39, "truncated": false}, "closest_source_line": {"line": 70, "lexical_ratio": 0.8923, "text": "- 转大火，下入熟花生，干辣椒和花椒；加入鸡精 2g，香醋 5g，白糖 2g，翻炒均匀；", "characters": 44, "truncated": false}, "format_hint": {"long_payload_lines": 1, "supported_lines": 0, "unsupported_lines": 1, "all_long_payload_lines_supported": false, "note": "仅作格式差异排查线索，不代表语义正确，不自动放行"}}, {"step_id": "201002484", "name": "步骤8", "step_order": 8.0, "owner_ids": ["201002454"], "normalized_characters": 30, "reasons": ["description_not_in_target_source"], "description": {"text": "10g淀粉加50g水调成水淀粉，倒入锅中快速翻炒收汁至理想浓度", "characters": 31, "truncated": false}, "closest_source_line": {"line": 71, "lexical_ratio": 0.7188, "text": "- 淀粉 10g 加 50g 清水调成水淀粉，加入锅中，翻炒均匀，收汁到自己想要的浓度", "characters": 43, "truncated": false}, "format_hint": {"long_payload_lines": 1, "supported_lines": 0, "unsupported_lines": 1, "all_long_payload_lines_supported": false, "note": "仅作格式差异排查线索，不代表语义正确，不自动放行"}}, {"step_id": "201002485", "name": "步骤9", "step_order": 9.0, "owner_ids": ["201002454"], "normalized_characters": 16, "reasons": ["description_not_in_target_source"], "description": {"text": "关火淋入芝麻油10g，翻匀即可出锅", "characters": 17, "truncated": false}, "closest_source_line": {"line": 72, "lexical_ratio": 0.9333, "text": "- 关火，淋入芝麻油 10g，即可出锅", "characters": 19, "truncated": false}, "format_hint": {"long_payload_lines": 1, "supported_lines": 0, "unsupported_lines": 1, "all_long_payload_lines_supported": false, "note": "仅作格式差异排查线索，不代表语义正确，不自动放行"}}]}, "ingredients": [{"ingredient_id": "201002455", "name": "手枪腿", "source_name_present": true}, {"ingredient_id": "201002456", "name": "鸡胸脯肉", "source_name_present": true}, {"ingredient_id": "201002457", "name": "大葱", "source_name_present": true}, {"ingredient_id": "201002458", "name": "干辣椒", "source_name_present": true}, {"ingredient_id": "201002459", "name": "二荆条", "source_name_present": true}, {"ingredient_id": "201002460", "name": "熟花生", "source_name_present": true}, {"ingredient_id": "201002461", "name": "生花生", "source_name_present": true}, {"ingredient_id": "201002462", "name": "莴笋", "source_name_present": true}, {"ingredient_id": "201002463", "name": "姜片", "source_name_present": true}, {"ingredient_id": "201002464", "name": "生抽酱油", "source_name_present": true}, {"ingredient_id": "201002465", "name": "老抽酱油", "source_name_present": true}, {"ingredient_id": "201002466", "name": "香醋", "source_name_present": true}, {"ingredient_id": "201002467", "name": "白糖", "source_name_present": true}, {"ingredient_id": "201002468", "name": "料酒", "source_name_present": true}, {"ingredient_id": "201002469", "name": "盐", "source_name_present": true}, {"ingredient_id": "201002470", "name": "鸡精", "source_name_present": true}, {"ingredient_id": "201002471", "name": "淀粉", "source_name_present": true}, {"ingredient_id": "201002472", "name": "植物油", "source_name_present": true}, {"ingredient_id": "201002473", "name": "芝麻油", "source_name_present": true}, {"ingredient_id": "201002474", "name": "花椒", "source_name_present": true}, {"ingredient_id": "201002475", "name": "豆瓣酱", "source_name_present": true}, {"ingredient_id": "201002476", "name": "油泼辣子", "source_name_present": true}], "vector_audit_after_graph_rejection": true, "diagnostic_vector_status": "read", "chunks": {"count": 4, "limit": 20, "may_be_truncated": false, "items": [{"chunk_id": "201002454_chunk_499", "node_id": "201002454", "parent_id": "201002454", "node_type": "Recipe", "recipe_name": "宫保鸡丁", "doc_type": "chunk", "reasons": ["text_not_verified"], "passes_current_checks": false, "duplicate": false, "text": {"text": "# 宫保鸡丁\n\n菜系: 川菜\n难度: 4.0星\n\n时间信息: 准备时间: 1小时10分钟（含腌制1小时）, 烹饪时间: 约15分钟\n份量: 1-2人\n", "characters": 75, "truncated": false}, "closest_source_line": {"line": 66, "lexical_ratio": 0.1802, "text": "- 鸡丁中加入盐 2g，老抽酱油 5g，料酒 15g，淀粉 15g 搅拌均匀，至微微发干；缓慢加入部分葱姜水，搅拌鸡丁至粘手；保鲜膜密封，放入冰箱腌制 1 小时", "characters": 80, "truncated": false}, "format_hint": {"long_payload_lines": 1, "supported_lines": 0, "unsupported_lines": 1, "all_long_payload_lines_supported": false, "note": "仅作格式差异排查线索，不代表语义正确，不自动放行"}}, {"chunk_id": "201002454_chunk_500", "node_id": "201002454", "parent_id": "201002454", "node_type": "Recipe", "recipe_name": "宫保鸡丁", "doc_type": "chunk", "reasons": ["text_not_verified"], "passes_current_checks": false, "duplicate": false, "text": {"text": "## 所需食材\n1. 二荆条(4支)\n2. 大葱(180g)\n3. 姜片(10g)\n4. 干辣椒(10g)\n5. 手枪腿(350g)\n6. 料酒(15g)\n7. 植物油(20g)\n8. 油泼辣子(5g)\n9. 淀粉(25g)\n10. 熟花生(150g)\n11. 生抽酱油(10g)\n12. 生花生(150g)\n13. 白糖(2g)\n14. 盐(2g)\n15. 老抽酱油(5g)\n16. 芝麻油(10g)\n17. 花椒(5g)\n18. 莴笋(250g)\n19. 豆瓣酱(10g)\n20. 香醋(5g)\n21. 鸡精(2g)\n22. 鸡胸脯肉(350g)\n", "characters": 276, "truncated": false}, "closest_source_line": {"line": 82, "lexical_ratio": 0.1422, "text": "- 鸡丁中加入盐 2g，老抽酱油 5g，料酒 15g，淀粉 15g 搅拌均匀，至微微发干；缓慢加入部分葱姜水，搅拌鸡丁至粘手；保鲜膜密封，放入冰箱腌制 1 小时", "characters": 80, "truncated": false}, "format_hint": {"long_payload_lines": 1, "supported_lines": 0, "unsupported_lines": 1, "all_long_payload_lines_supported": false, "note": "仅作格式差异排查线索，不代表语义正确，不自动放行"}}, {"chunk_id": "201002454_chunk_501", "node_id": "201002454", "parent_id": "201002454", "node_type": "Recipe", "recipe_name": "宫保鸡丁", "doc_type": "chunk", "reasons": ["text_not_verified"], "passes_current_checks": false, "duplicate": false, "text": {"text": "## 制作步骤\n\n### 第1步\n步骤: 步骤1\n描述: 手枪腿去骨，用刀背拍松后切成1.5cm见方肉丁，清水浸泡10分钟，捞出控干备用\n方法: 切,腌制\n工具: 剪刀,刀,碗\n时间: 10分钟\n\n### 第2步\n步骤: 步骤2\n描述: 大葱绿与5g姜片加50g开水泡成葱姜水；葱白切1.5cm圆粒；花生微波高火5分钟焙干\n方法: 切,加热\n工具: 刀,微波炉\n时间: 5分钟\n\n### 第3步\n步骤: 步骤3\n描述: 鸡丁加盐2g、老抽5g、料酒15g、淀粉15g拌匀至发干，再分次加入葱姜水搅至粘手，盖膜冷藏腌1小时\n方法: 腌制\n工具: 碗,保鲜膜,冰箱\n时间: 1小时\n\n### 第4步\n步骤: 步骤4\n描述: 干辣椒切段；小火焙干辣椒至微糊，再焙香花椒，分别捞出备用\n方法: 炒,焙\n工具: 炒锅,锅铲\n时间: 2-3分钟\n\n### 第5步\n步骤: 步骤5\n描述: 大火热锅倒20g油，7成热下鸡丁煎至表面发白，翻面再煎30秒后翻炒均匀\n方法: 煎,炒\n工具: 炒锅,锅铲\n时间: 1-2分钟\n\n### 第6步\n步骤: 步骤6\n描述: 加入葱粒翻炒，倒入剩余葱姜水（不足100g补热水），盖盖中小火焖2分钟\n方法: 炒,焖\n工具: 炒锅,锅盖\n时间: 2分钟\n\n### 第7步\n步骤: 步骤7\n描述: 开盖转大火，加入熟花生、干辣椒、花椒，调入鸡精2g、香醋5g、白糖2g翻炒均匀\n方法: 炒\n工具: 锅铲\n时间: 30秒\n\n### 第8步\n步骤: 步骤8\n描述: 10g淀粉加50g水调成水淀粉，倒入锅中快速翻炒收汁至理想浓度\n方法: 勾芡\n工具: 锅铲\n时间: 30秒\n\n### 第9步\n步骤: 步骤9\n描述: 关火淋入芝麻油10g，翻匀即可出锅\n方法: 淋油\n工具: 锅铲\n时间: 10秒\n", "characters": 753, "truncated": false}, "closest_source_line": {"line": 66, "lexical_ratio": 0.2149, "text": "- 鸡丁中加入盐 2g，老抽酱油 5g，料酒 15g，淀粉 15g 搅拌均匀，至微微发干；缓慢加入部分葱姜水，搅拌鸡丁至粘手；保鲜膜密封，放入冰箱腌制 1 小时", "characters": 80, "truncated": false}, "format_hint": {"long_payload_lines": 9, "supported_lines": 0, "unsupported_lines": 9, "all_long_payload_lines_supported": false, "note": "仅作格式差异排查线索，不代表语义正确，不自动放行"}}, {"chunk_id": "201002454_chunk_502", "node_id": "201002454", "parent_id": "201002454", "node_type": "Recipe", "recipe_name": "宫保鸡丁", "doc_type": "chunk", "reasons": ["text_not_verified"], "passes_current_checks": false, "duplicate": false, "text": {"text": "## 标签\n辣椒可去籽减辣,花生微波焙干更脆,葱姜水分次加入更嫩滑", "characters": 33, "truncated": false}, "closest_source_line": {"line": 95, "lexical_ratio": 0.2273, "text": "辣椒依据个人口味酌量添加，怕辣可去籽；", "characters": 19, "truncated": false}, "format_hint": {"long_payload_lines": 1, "supported_lines": 0, "unsupported_lines": 1, "all_long_payload_lines_supported": false, "note": "仅作格式差异排查线索，不代表语义正确，不自动放行"}}], "production_eligible": false}}
